        "text": "Managing a team can be tricky in a fast-paced environment, but what happens when someone is out of office?\n\nMeet my ClickUp Super Agent.\n \nThis OOO Tag Monitor is sweeping across ClickUp while I go about my day, alerting me to mentions of a team member who is OOO, so I can jump in, reroute urgent items, and keep work moving while someone is enjoying well-earned PTO or taking time to rest, recharge, and get healthy.\n\nIt turns a potentially disruptive situation that creates added, surprise work to your plate into a seamless process that gives everyone peace of mind to actually focus on what's most important.\n\nWhat's something you'd love to hand off to a Super Agent to lighten the load? 🏝️\n\nP.S. thank you Camron Newby for letting me use you as an example!",
