        "text": "Most companies are failing at adopting AI.\n \nNot because they're not trying. But because AI isn't meant to be adopted. It's meant to be adapted to you.\n \nToday, ClickUp is launching Super Agents – AI agents that understand your work context, adapt to your workflows, and natively work in your tools to maximize your productivity.\n \nThey operate as real users in your workspace with permissions, tasks, and guardrails, so every action is transparent and grounded in your actual work.\n \n🎥 Check out the launch video below to see what Super Agents can do.\n\nP.S. If the wheels are turning about the Super Agents you want to create – send me a DM and we'll brainstorm with you!",
