          "date": "10mo",
          "parsed_datetime": "2025-09-03T19:11:29.244Z",
          "text": "Huge thanks to our amazing team and users for making this happen. 💜\n\nBeing recognized on the Cloud 100 is a testament to the team's relentless focus and execution, and it's exceptionally special in 2025 with AI reshaping our industry.\n\nWe first founded ClickUp to maximize human productivity, and now, as the first fully-converged AI Workspace, we're delivering on that vision.\n\nAnd the best is yet to come. I couldn't be more excited about what ClickUp will be delivering in the next few months 👀",
